# fixedbugs, defect 2036, 2026-10-13, a shape beside defect 2034's repair.
#
# SYMPTOM: a header of the program's own whose `printf("", 5)` hands an
# empty format an argument was refused `ffi_header_refused` at exit 1,
# `format string is empty [-Werror,-Wformat-zero-length]`, since defect 2034
# kept `-Wformat` an error in the region as a group; C11 7.21.6.1p2 defines
# it, the argument an excess one, evaluated and otherwise ignored.
#
# FIX: `-Wformat-zero-length` is passed over after the group is raised
# (`emit/header_region.hero`'s `FORMAT_DEFINED`), so the header builds and
# the call prints nothing and returns 0.

extern "fixedbugs-2036-a-header-s-own-printf-of-an-empty-format-given-an-argument-builds.h"
    function fmt_empty() -> i32

function main()
    print(fmt_empty())
